flowchart TD
  A[Git Commit] --> B[Detect Changed Files]
  B --> C{Performance-sensitive Change?}
  C -- No --> D[Skip / defer performance test]
  D --> E[Record decision]
  C -- Yes --> F[Start controlled test environment]
  F --> G[Run performance test]
  G --> H[Collect JTL]
  H --> I[Calculate p95]
  I --> J[Compare with baseline]
  J --> K{p95 regression?}
  K -- No --> L[PASS]
  K -- Yes --> M[FLAG REGRESSION]
  M --> N[Developer review]
